OL,4,CProtesters disrupt Sir Paul Smith's    
OL,5,Cbook talk                              
OL,6,GFashion firm Paul Smith has told the   
OL,7,GBBC it is committed to animal welfare  
OL,8,Gafter protesters disrupted a talk by   
OL,9,Gthe brand's founder in his home city.  
OL,11,FTwo supporters of People for the       
OL,12,FEthical Treatment of Animals (PETA)    
OL,13,Finterrupted the event hosted by Sir    
OL,14,FPaul Smith at Nottingham's Broadway    
OL,15,FCinema on Wednesday.                   
